<div id="about" class="container width-100 justify-end">
    <div class="col padd-y-8 gap-8">
        <div class="col gap-4">
            <div class="col">
                <h2>Let's get to the nitty gritty.</h2>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row gap-10" data-stack="768">
        <div class="col gap-4">
            <img class="img foto" src="/assets/images/about/rojo@2x.png"
                srcset="<%= imgSrcset('/assets/images/about/rojo@2x.png') %>" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 90vw, 400px"
                alt="Portrait of David Rojo" width="812" height="812" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </div>
        <div class="col gap-6">
            <div class="row">
                <%- include('../../components/about-switch'); %>
            </div>
            <p class="about-content marg-0">
                With the heart of an artist, the brain of an engineer, and the speed of a mongoose. <strong>David Rojo
                    is a
                    multidisciplinary designer, illustrator, and developer </strong> who is a sucker for good branding,
                micro-interactions, and learning how things work under the hood.
                <br><br>
                I have spent most of my career working with start-ups and smaller independent companies, multiple times
                as the founding designer. I excel at building zero-to-one products by understanding business objectives
                and discovering user pain points. I position companies for growth through differentiation and
                operational improvements, solving complex problems through research and experimentation.
                <br><br>
                Currently, I lead all product and design initiatives at a med-tech startup that is changing the standard
                of care in dental radiology, facilitating ideas while also shipping directly to production. When time
                allows, I also moonlight in the adult beverage industry, leveraging illustration to create distinctive
                brands, labels, and merchandise.
            </p>
            <ul class="col gap-4 about-content display-none">
                <li><b>Product Leadership:</b> I research, discover, and plan what's actually worth building ensuring
                    time isn't wasted on endeavors that don't improve the user experience or business outcomes.</li>
                <li><b>Design Systems:</b> Establishing a system ensures
                    your
                    experience remains consistent and eliminates drift. I create rules and build libraries
                    that can be synced and installed on any framework.
                </li>
                <li><b>Product Design:</b> From wireframes to rapid functional prototypes. I design, test, and build
                    polished interfaces that remove user friction and feel great to use.
                </li>
                <li><b>Front-End Development:</b> I learned to code before AI became mainstream. While I learned the
                    full stack, I specialize in front-end development, ensuring the that most minute details are not
                    overlooked.
                <li><b>Identity & Branding:</b> I love helping young companies grow and position themselves. I create
                    consistent visual languages and guidelines ensuring your business is scaleable and unique across all
                    mediums.
                </li>
                <li><b>Vector Illustration:</b> From icons to t-shirts, design should be fun and I get it all done.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="about-content marg-0 display-none">
                Sample Text

            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>